tmoe-python (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Python 3.10+ rewrite
  * Complete rewrite from shell scripts to Python
  * Modern TUI interface using Textual
  * Support for Proot, Chroot, and Docker containers
  * GUI desktop environment installation (XFCE, LXDE, MATE, KDE, GNOME)
  * VNC/noVNC remote desktop support
  * Application center with package manager integration
  * Mirror source management for China users
  * Container backup and restore functionality
  * Cross-architecture support with QEMU
  * Internationalization support (Chinese, Japanese, English)
  * LXC image downloading from official mirrors

